<%--
Rsx_Form

The form component - value state, dirty tracking, client validation, submission and
error rendering, in one pipeline. See Rsx_Form.js for the contract summary.

The template is deliberately minimal and framework-owned. Failure feedback renders in
the <Form_Errors /> the form's content places wherever its LAYOUT wants it (inside a
section, above a grid) - see Form_Errors.jqhtml. Layout, labels and styling belong to
the content the application composes inside (Form_Field, the form grid, .form-actions).

  $controller  (required) - controller class name; with $method, names the ONE endpoint
  $method      (required) - Ajax endpoint method on that controller
  $data        (optional) - seed values for an edit form; omit for a pristine create form

  <Rsx_Form $controller="Frontend_Tasks_Controller" $method="save" $data=this.data.form_data>
      <Form_Field $label="Title" $required=true>
          <Text_Input $name="title" />
      </Form_Field>
      <div class="form-actions">
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Save</button>
      </div>
  </Rsx_Form>
--%>
<Define:Rsx_Form tag="form">

    <div $sid="form_content">

        <%= content() %>

    </div>

</Define:Rsx_Form>
